{
  "name": "CF-01 Auth API (Login & Register)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CF-01 · Auth API  `POST /webhook/cf/auth`\nBody: `{action:'login'|'register', email, password, full_name?}` → `{token, user}`\n\n• Passwords are checked **inside Postgres with bcrypt** (`crypt()`), never compared in n8n.\n• 5 wrong passwords → account locked 15 min. Every attempt is audited.\n• Only **candidates** can self-register; employee/HR accounts are created by an admin in SQL.\n• The JWT is signed with the secret in the **CF JWT Signing Key** credential (HS256, 4 h candidates / 8 h staff).\n• Workflow settings: executions are **not saved** (they would contain passwords).",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 820,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "6bf5f26b-9c12-4043-890f-c7c8170cc0ba",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
